meta {
  name: 4 Mark message read
  type: http
  seq: 4
}
post {
  url: {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/messages/{{messageId}}/read
  body: none
}
docs {
  Only the **recipient** may mark a message read. A sender marking their own message read is
  meaningless, and permitting it would let a sender probe whether an id exists.

  A missing message and somebody else's message answer **identically** (`403`), so this cannot be used
  to enumerate message ids.

  `204 No Content` on success — no body. Set `{{messageId}}` from an `id` in the inbox or thread
  response.
}
